  "sources": [
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Flow of the World",
          "desc": "Channels the Flow into the body to gain Attack Speed and enhance one of four stats: Health/Attack/Movement Speed/Cooldown. Can spend Flow to perform an enhanced Basic Attack that deals piercing physical damage."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Convergence",
          "desc": "Deals physical damage to nearby enemies and knocks them back. Gains Health recovery, 5 stacks of Flow, and reduces the cooldown of Arrow of No Retreat and Arrowstorm."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Arrow of No Retreat",
          "desc": "Shoots an enormous projectile at the target, dealing physical damage and knocking back non-hero units. Can dash a short distance after use."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Arrowstorm",
          "desc": "Shoots multiple light projectiles at the target area, dealing physical damage and gaining Movement Speed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Great self-peel",
          "Excellent DPS",
          "Strong poke damage"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Vulnerable to crowd control",
          "Weak Early Game",
          "Can be punished by Assassins"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nFocus on farming and last-hitting minions to maximise the amount of gold you get. Use Skill 1 before getting to the minion wave so you can pierce through all the minions at once to help with your clear. Skill 2 can be used on minions to close the gap to the enemy to help you poke or help you escape danger.\n\n## Teamfights\nIn teamfights, always keep an eye on your positioning. Stay behind your team so you don't get jumped on by assassins. When using Flowborn marksman Ultimate, you will be a little exposed, so be sure to use it in a safe position. Save Skill 2 to reposition, whether that's away from the enemy to escape or close the gap to help you finish off low-health enemy heroes.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nIn base Passive: Early Game > Damage ; Late Game > Movement Speed\nUse Ultimate twice to levitate over walls\nSkill 2 can be used to help last-hit minions or for mobility in fights"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
